requires-openspec: true
---
To initialise OpenSpec in this project, please run:

`openspec init`

This will create the required directory structure:
- openspec/config.yaml
- openspec/changes/
- openspec/specs/

After initialisation, use {{#recommend}}command:openspec/list?force{{/recommend}} to refresh the cached changes list.
